        "anchor": "ros-scene-1-landing"
      },
      "text": "Title: Scene 1: The Ferry Landing\\nSummary: Maren Holt meets the party at the jetty and asks them to restart the mill.\\nLocation: loc-ferry-landing\\nRead aloud: The ferry bumps against a rotting jetty. Across the reeds a tall stone mill stands silent, its great wheel hanging still above brown water. A woman in a patched coat waits on the planks with her arms folded.\\nBranch target: ros-scene-2-yard\\nBranch: Proceed from the jetty to the mill yard.\\nBranch target: ros-branch-shrine\\nBranch: Follow the reed path to the left of the jetty toward the shrine."
    },
    {
      "id": "premise",
      "kind": "premise",
      "visibility": "player-visible",
