      "text": "Background: The flour mill at Greywater Bend has stopped, the village is hungry, and the miller has vanished.\\nHook: Maren Holt meets the party at the ferry landing and asks them to restart the mill before the village runs out of bread.\\nTheme: mystery; investigation; rural-intrigue\\nTone: tense, grounded"
